			"notes": "## Changes:\n* Added loot table search, allowing you to find any lootable block entities based on the loot table they might or might not have.\n* Hovering over the search results will show you the matched item stacks/loot tables.\n* Added keybinds to start normal/global search using data from currently held item.\n* Now using YetAnotherConfigLib for config, with a few new options. Check them out!\n* Updated to 1.21.4.\n* Cleaned up and lightly documented the code.\n\nNo required MC version? Pick the closest available one and pray."
		},
