			"notes": "### New stuff\n* Now works with: chest boats, item displays, lecterns and chiseled bookshelves.\n* Added config (requires Cloth Config):  \n          - Auto-confirm global search (disabled by default)\n          - Include item displays (disabled by default)\n* Added nested search for shulker boxes and bundles (only works reliably with Global search for some God forsaken reason)\n* You can teleport to search results by using a keybind (`N` by default)  \n  \nUsage info available in [README](https://github.com/Vladomeme/itemfinder/blob/master/README.md)"
